        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gomoku: first steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五目並べのはじめての遊び方（禁じ手あり）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gomoku: first steps (with forbidden moves)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このゲームの目的" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The goal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒と白が交互に石を置いて、先に自分の石を 5 つ並べるゲームです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black and white take turns placing stones. Be first to line up five of yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "たて・よこ・ななめ、どの向きでもかまいません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Across, down or diagonally — any direction counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回の番でやること" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What to do on your turn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空いている交点をタップして、石を置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap an empty point to place a stone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめの設定は 2 回タップ。1 回目は仮の石、同じ交点をもう一度タップで置きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By default it takes two taps: the first shows a trial stone, tapping the same point again places it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒が先手、白が後手です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black goes first, white second."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手の列を止める" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Block your opponent's line"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相手が 4 つ並べたら、次の一手で 5 つになってしまいます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your opponent lines up four, the next move makes five."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あいている端に石を置いて、止めましょう。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Place a stone on the open end to stop it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒の禁じ手" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Forbidden moves for Black"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "禁じ手ありのときは、黒だけ打てない場所があります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With forbidden moves on, there are points only Black can't play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三三・四四・長連（6 つ以上）になる場所です。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These are points that make double-three, double-four, or an overline (six or more)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "白には禁じ手がありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "White has no forbidden moves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勝ち負けの決まり" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to win or lose"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先に 5 つ並べた方の勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever lines up five first wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "黒はちょうど 5 つで勝ち（6 つ以上は禁じ手）。白は 6 つ以上でも勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black wins with exactly five (six or more is forbidden). White wins even with six or more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤が全部埋まったら引き分けです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the board fills up, it is a draw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先に 5 つ並べた方の勝ちです。6 つ以上並んでも勝ちです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever lines up five first wins. Six or more also wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 つ並んだ！" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Five in a row!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
